    "If cᵢ>0 and x,y are positive with ∑ᵢ xᵢ/cᵢ=∑ᵢ yᵢ/cᵢ=1, set L=∑ᵢ|xᵢ−yᵢ| and M=∑ᵢ 2cᵢ(xᵢ−yᵢ)²/(xᵢ+yᵢ). Then L²≤M≤(Dψ(x)−Dψ(y))[x−y]."
  ],
